  era: "c. 1500\u20131000 BCE \xB7 Section 3 \xB7 Vedic Period \xB7 c. 1500 \u2013 600 BCE"
  title: Early Vedic economy
  text: The early Vedic economy was largely pastoral. Cattle were the main wealth and wars were fought over them; gavishti, the search for cows, meant battle. There was also some barley farming, weaving, carpentry and work in copper and bronze.
